$$ Correspondingly eq. (6.16) can be rewritten as $$
\forall \Xi \in \mathbb {V} _ {i n} ^ {0}; \quad \mathfrak {p} \left(\Xi ; \underbrace {\boldsymbol {\theta} , \mathfrak {W} , \boldsymbol {\Psi}} _ {\zeta}\right) = \sigma \left(\widehat {\delta} \left(\widetilde {\boldsymbol {\mathcal {U}}} _ {[ \mathfrak {W}, \boldsymbol {\Psi} ]} (\Xi), \mathfrak {S} [ \boldsymbol {\theta} ]\right)\right) \tag {6.19}
